    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00009_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalkAsync:0",
      "Original": "(Oh. It's Bun-chan.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00010_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "What's up? Did something happen in the dungeon? Why are you wandering around muttering nonsense?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00011_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Don't you talk to me, <i>snip</i>!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00012_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Wait, I'm just worried about you.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00013_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "I'm trying not to forget what the Great Yamawaki asked me to buy for her, <i>snip</i>!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00014_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Great! Now I did forget! This is all your fault, <i>snip</i>!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00015_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Wasn't it pork, potatoes, onions, soy sauce, sugar, and mirin?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00016_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Thanks, peasant, <i>snip</i>!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00017_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.playCutIn:3",
      "Original": "Don't listen to her!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00018_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Wakkie!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00019_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Master?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00020_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "If Bun-chan is supposed to be running an errand for you, why're you here?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00021_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "B-Because...I was checking to see if she was obeying my orders!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00022_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "It was all a test, <i>snip</i>?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00023_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Heh. That's right. You were doing fine for a while there...until you fell right into this <i>stranger's</i> little trap!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00024_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Oh no, <i>snip</i>!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00025_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "I'm a stranger? Bun-chan and I are practically best buds now.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00026_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "What are you saying, <i>snip</i>?! Everyone but the Great Yamawaki is my enemy! Don't try to trick me, <i>snip</i>!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00027_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "You heard her, Kayamori. Stand down, if you know what's good for you. Bwa ha ha!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00028_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Uh, wait... So was this whole event just pointless, then?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00029_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "You better sleep with one eye open, peasant! Ke he he he, <i>snip</i>!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00030_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Mwahahaha!!!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_08_10_00_World_00031_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "(I still have no idea what to make of their relationship...)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Patrol_MC02_00000_MAsami",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "You, Kayamori. A word.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Patrol_MC02_00001_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "What can I do for ya?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_00004_v004_MAsami",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Mind taking on a patrol mission? We're low on troops and could use the help.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_00005_v004_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "What kind of mission are we talking?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_00006_v004_MAsami",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "We've received reports of a powerful Cancer lurking around one of the domes.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_00007_v004_MAsami",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Your task would be to scout out the surrounding area and eliminate the Cancer in question.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_00008_v004_MAsami",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "More experience in the field would serve you newbies well. If you could find the time to tackle this, I'd really appreciate it.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_00009_v004_MAsami",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "You will be compensated for your efforts, of course.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_00269_v002_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Hmm, I'll think about it.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_00270_v002_MAsami",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "I'll be on standby in front of the heliport. Come see me if you decide to take this on.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC01_00271_v002_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "Will do.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    }
  ],
  "Inserts": []
}